        <br>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small> </small></font>
        <br><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1"><small>461 Posts</small></font></td>
        <td bgcolor="gainsboro" colspan="2" valign="top">
		<a name="50614"></a>
		<img src="icon_mi_1.gif" border="0" hspace="3"><font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="1">Posted&nbsp;-&nbsp;04/06/2005&nbsp;:&nbsp; 13:09:05</font>

		&nbsp;<a href="pop_profile.asp?mode=display&id=4"><img src="icon_profile.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Show Profile" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>
        
			&nbsp;<a href="JavaScript:openWindow('pop_mail.asp?id=4')"><img src="icon_email.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Email Poster" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

				&nbsp;<a href="privatesend.asp?method=Topic&mname=Kaashar"><img src="pm.gif" width="11" height="17" alt="Send Kaashar a Private Message" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        &nbsp;<a href="JavaScript:openWindow('pop_messengers.asp?mode=ICQ&ICQ=749934&M_NAME=Kaashar')"><img src="http://online.mirabilis.com/scripts/online.dll?icq=749934&img=5" height=15 width=15 alt="Send Kaashar an ICQ Message" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?ARCHIVE=&method=ReplyQuote&REPLY_ID=50614&TOPIC_ID=8298&FORUM_ID=27&CAT_ID=6&Forum_Title=World+of+Warcraft&Topic_Title=Kaashar%27s+Big+Group+PvP+101&M="><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Reply with Quote" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>

        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> <ul><BR><li>For the love of Uther, DO NOT GO NEAR TARREN MILL.  Ok, lemme reiterate this one, cause it's important.  DO NOT GO NEAR TARREN MILL.   Their guards are superior than the southshore ones.  It's a known fact, and horde players love to lure Alliance into town and fear them (side note, don't even bother using your fears if you see undead, you'll just waste time).</li></P><P><li>If you're a night elf, you can eat/drink while shadowmelded.  Start your food/drink, THEN shadowmeld.   Hotkye Shadowmeld, it's your PvP friend!  Running back to your corpse? Click "Resurrect" then slam your shadowmeld button.   Wait a few sconds, and mount your horse.  You'll remain cloaked until the horse pops out and you can run off.   One less time you get ganked buffless and at half health.</li></P><P><li> Use terrain to your advantage!  One of the reasons horde hate fighting outside southshore and drag alliance to TM is the terrain.   More hills, trees, etc around SS.   The less your enemy knows about your position the better.  See a warrior putting the beat down on an alliance rogue?  Hide in the bushes and attack instead of jumping out in the open.    I can't relate how many times I've seen alliance hunters run OUT of the bushes to stand in the field to engage an enemy.   I felt like they should have just marked themselves and saved the opposing faction the time.</li></P><P></P><P><BR></ul></P><P></P><P>I'll add more things as I think of them. I'm sure no expect, but I'm passing along some of the things I've learned along the way.<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
      </tr>

