        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Are you an undead warlock? Because when I face the hoard at least 40% of them are outright immune to my one defensive spell, fear, being undead.  I used my Imp all night on wednesday and still went thru 42 souls in under an hour. After that it was more me annoying them with dots when they rushed forward, and hoping my death coil would recharge so I would have an instant cast for emergencies. I think I killed a total of three people all night.</P><P>What I learned is the Imp makes a good guided missle, dispoable worth a good 2-3k damage if the person is curse of elemented. And that spellstones are really worthwhile to use in pvp, especially when a couple mages load up on arcane missles on you.</P><P><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
