        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I had a 60 warlock face me down solo a couple times yesterday.   I won both times, and cost him several shards in the process.</P><P>I really feel you guy's pain for the shard cost.</P><P>From being on the receiving end, smart locks hide in the middle of the pack and lay dots on things like charging warriors, suicide an imp on those annoying bubbled mages and shadow priests.</P><P>I love having Syl at my back.  You killed more people than you realized bro, many times your dots were finishing them off after I sent them scampering.   I *know* you were the reason we got 2 mage kills that night.<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
