        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Actually, no, I am an Orc Warlock.  Was my original plan to be undead, but waaaaay to many people playing them for my taste.  I do duel quite a bit vs. my undead friends though, and WoTF is very much a PITA.   I can only pray that one patch note where fear and charm are going on the same diminishing return timer is a fake.   If not, shaman is looking better and better.   I will also be honest in the fact that my survival rate is so high because of demonology.  Thats is my major tree I spec in.   I run about 50/50 in duels with undead rogues.  The only classes that beat me more often than not are Shamans and *very* well played priests, that are not shadow specced.</P><P>For normal pvp(non-duel), I try to limit my shard usage to pets and health stones.<BR>My favorite mass pvp pet is the fel-hunter.   I drive alliance people into absolute fits of fury with him.</P><P><BR>Question for Sylver, are you a destructo lock?  Just curious because of how many shards you are burning ^_^</P><P>Blackedge Shadowbringer:<BR>65 Dread Lord of Bertoxxulous<BR><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=25967" target="_blank">http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=25967</a></P><P>Edited by - Blackedge on 04/08/2005  08:58:38<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
